 "remarks": "With the autumn season, here's a wonderful opportunity to own rather than rent, your own luxury condo nestled in a beautiful country setting, at Rolling Ridge Condominium's, one of Norwalk's finest places to live. The exterior buildings have just been freshly painted with a new parking lot and new boiler systems. Amenities that include: in-ground swimming pool, picturesque pond with fountains, handball/tennis court, and clubhouse with shower facilities. Located in the cul-de-sac is unit 332 featuring 1 bedroom, 1.5 bath with a den. Features include; large bedroom with remolded full bath and his and hers large double closets; a den/office or extra guest room; large living room with large widows; and kitchen with brand new refrigerator and stove appliances as well as tile floor. Ample closet space throughout, great layout and flow makes this unit and complex a place to feel like home!",
